# College Chatbot - Tanglish Support

Flask la panna simple college chatbot. Tanglish la kettalum puriyum.

Run panna:
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py

Features:
- Vanakam, fees evlo, hostel eruka/erukka/iruka ellame work aagum
- Fees, Hostel, Placement, Bus, Library pathi reply varum